
# Python bytecode from running the test suite locally
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Screenshots. The browser harnesses under Tools/ are driven by throwaway
# scripts that write PNGs with a RELATIVE path, and they run with the working
# directory at the repo root — so five of them were swept into commits by a
# `git add -A`. Real app artwork lives in assets/, which this does not touch.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.gif
/*.webp
